WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.559
Carabas floated in the river.

2
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.340
Rough hands suddenly grabbed him.

3
00:00:13.341 --> 00:00:17.502
"What's going on?" Carabas cried.

4
00:00:17.503 --> 00:00:22.102
Two men carried him out of the river.

5
00:00:22.103 --> 00:00:27.163
"You're safe now," one man said.

6
00:00:27.164 --> 00:00:32.076
"But . . ." Carabas was confused. "What—?"

7
00:00:32.077 --> 00:00:36.957
"Master!" Puss ran to him.

8
00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:40.414
"Thank goodness you're okay!"

9
00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:45.924
He winked at Carabas.

10
00:00:45.925 --> 00:00:51.029
Another man walked over.

11
00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:59.329
Carabas gulped. It was the king!

12
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.066
"Guards!" the king said. "Ride to the castle.

13
00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:12.909
Get dry clothes for the duke."

14
00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:17.116
The guards rode off.

15
00:01:17.117 --> 00:01:22.429
Soon they were back with dry clothing.

16
00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:31.679
Carabas put on the fine clothes.

17
00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:34.233
"Duke," the king said.

18
00:01:34.234 --> 00:01:36.965
"It's nice to meet you!"

19
00:01:36.966 --> 00:01:42.347
Carabas bowed. "Thank you, Your Majesty.

20
00:01:42.348 --> 00:01:45.109
But I must tell you . . ."

21
00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:49.566
Suddenly Carabas heard beautiful music.

22
00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:53.519
"Who is playing the guitar?" he asked.

23
00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:58.329
The king smiled. "That's my daughter."

24
00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:03.203
"What beautiful music!" Carabas said.

25
00:02:03.204 --> 00:02:06.287
The king laughed.

26
00:02:06.288 --> 00:02:10.113
"Yes, my daughter is very talented.

27
00:02:10.114 --> 00:02:14.506
Oh, what did you want to tell me?"

28
00:02:14.507 --> 00:02:17.350
"Huh?" Carabas said.

29
00:02:17.351 --> 00:02:21.103
He was still listening to the music.

30
00:02:21.104 --> 00:02:25.072
"What were you going to say?" the king asked.

31
00:02:25.073 --> 00:02:30.169
Carabas shook his head. "It . . . it was nothing."

32
00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.747
The king put his hand on Carabas' shoulder.

33
00:02:33.748 --> 00:02:38.820
"Come! Meet my daughter."

